Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifty-Second Episode\NThe Royal Wedding\NSilverland Happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.75,0:01:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, before we begin today's story,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.69,0:01:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}let me refresh your memory on what happened last time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.07,0:01:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Duralumin, a pawn of the X-Union,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.49,0:01:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}finally revealed his traitorous nature and{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.79,0:02:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}tried to kill the King, Queen, and Sapphire.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, betrayed by Nylon,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.53,0:02:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Duralumin met a swift end, and the crown fell into Nylon's hands.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.66,0:02:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As the king of Silverland, Nylon welcomed X-Union into the castle.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.11,0:02:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meanwhile, Sapphire bade farewell to her parents in the Skull Chamber{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.55,0:02:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and escaped the castle with three orbs—gold, silver, and bronze—{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.13,0:02:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}believed to hold the power to protect the kingdom.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.63,0:02:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She ran to seek help from Prince Franz.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.90,0:02:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.90,0:02:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the King and Queen were executed on Skull Island by the X-Union.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.71,0:02:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Three orbs...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.89,0:02:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What power do you truly hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.66,0:02:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really have power, please help Sapphire now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.82,0:03:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.14,0:03:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavenly Father, I'll do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.36,0:03:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So please, make Sapphire happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.15,0:03:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that sound of bells?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.54,0:03:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.62,0:03:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.56,0:03:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop it! Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.75,0:03:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind, Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.62,0:03:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I've learned the truth about those bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.64,0:04:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The people are ringing them to mourn the executed King and Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.00,0:04:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.27,0:04:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy every bell in the kingdom! And capture Sapphire immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.67,0:04:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Find her, no matter where she hides!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Tear down mountains if you must!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.49,0:04:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy every possible place Sapphire could be hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't even hear the bells anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:04:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and we've got no food or place to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.11,0:04:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Where on earth did Princess Sapphire go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.49,0:05:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The King and Queen have gone to heaven, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.05,0:05:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But Sapphire is fine, so I'm relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.86,0:05:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it ready yet, Tink?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet, not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.66,0:05:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuro no Ojisan is on lookout duty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.95,0:05:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, Hotoru-kun, I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.18,0:05:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahem!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.79,0:05:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a gift for the two of you from our forest friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.61,0:05:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.81,0:06:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.57,0:06:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.10,0:06:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.89,0:06:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like our present?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.48,0:06:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.65,0:06:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.94,0:06:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.87,0:06:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, here's a little bonus!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.40,0:06:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.54,0:07:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.41,0:07:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.93,0:07:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Crying at a time like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.03,0:07:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire really is a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.83,0:07:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard I try to be brave, I'm still so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.39,0:08:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to see my mother and father... one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.97,0:08:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire was enduring it all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.40,0:08:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavenly Father, I'll endure whatever painful trials come my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.71,0:08:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So please grant my prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Give Sapphire her mother and father back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.02,0:08:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please bring them back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.27,0:08:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,, I beg you, hear my wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.55,0:08:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavenly Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.45,0:08:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tink,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.11,0:08:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1} as a former angel,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.57,0:08:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}you know wishes aren't granted simply by speaking them.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.38,0:09:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you wish to save those you love,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.31,0:09:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}work for them with all your strength and all your heart.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.31,0:09:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I shall watch over you from here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.59,0:09:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Whether your wish is granted depends entirely on your efforts.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.40,0:09:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,For Sapphire's sake, I'll do anything, no matter how hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.63,0:09:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.93,0:09:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.04,0:09:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire will be so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Who brought this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.28,0:09:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The little mouse brought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can't eat this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.98,0:09:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.20,0:09:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We can ring the bell with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.91,0:09:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ring the bell to wake Sapphire up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.12,0:09:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.62,0:09:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire kept those three orbs put away so carefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.91,0:09:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But can't you give it back to me just for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:10:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to ring the bell with it and wake Sapphire up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.20,0:10:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be careful not to break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.14,0:10:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.15,0:10:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm gonna ring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It started ringing all by itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.83,0:10:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You attached the three jewels.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.73,0:10:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Those three jewels really do have a mysterious power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.43,0:10:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Legend says they protect the people, the royal family, and Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.45,0:10:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's a bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.25,0:11:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.50,0:11:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you to demolish all the bells!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.87,0:11:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, sir... the cause is completely unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.15,0:11:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.81,0:11:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop hesitating and smash it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.10,0:11:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.12,0:11:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My arms are itching for action!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.52,0:11:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna just stand around sulking either!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.84,0:11:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, it's time to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.38,0:11:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're driving X out of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.89,0:11:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.84,0:11:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's X!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you, X!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got our mysterious friend on our side!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.57,0:12:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lets go, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.48,0:12:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,, Opal, we're counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.16,0:12:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Lets go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.91,0:12:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Big brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.22,0:12:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,, Ring louder and louder!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.68,0:12:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Fools! Did you think you could defeat the X Army?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.27,0:12:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.19,0:12:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Trample them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.16,0:13:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What a powerful force!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.56,0:13:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Serves you right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.11,0:14:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.63,0:14:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Got 'em! They're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.14,0:14:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.16,0:14:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're saved! We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.65,0:14:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! We're trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we going to miss dinner?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.29,0:14:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I know the exit to this cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It comes out right next to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.28,0:14:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.32,0:14:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.42,0:14:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.19,0:14:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone, find me a\Nweapon—anything will do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.84,0:14:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take it\Nand storm the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.71,0:14:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it! We can make them using the three orbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.42,0:15:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.38,0:15:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the top woodworkers in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,, I see. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.56,0:15:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink should have those three orbs!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.41,0:15:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.75,0:15:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.00,0:15:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.00,0:15:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.94,0:15:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.17,0:15:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.72,0:15:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.66,0:15:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.22,0:15:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.88,0:15:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.72,0:15:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I was making a weapon with the orbs to protect Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.47,0:15:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.23,0:15:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, time to show of our skills as blacksmiths!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.29,0:16:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.89,0:16:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This power is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.58,0:16:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.62,0:16:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.40,0:16:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it from the leftover metal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.01,0:16:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure this horn has the same power as those metal orbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.82,0:16:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Blow it for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.72,0:16:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.26,0:16:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.68,0:16:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.53,0:16:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.89,0:16:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.56,0:16:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.44,0:16:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.41,0:16:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.99,0:16:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.47,0:16:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let you put yourself in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.56,0:16:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Sapphire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.81,0:17:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.97,0:17:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.57,0:17:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine! Quick, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.91,0:17:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the mysterious power of the Royal Orb!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.74,0:17:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Now is the time to crush X!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.63,0:17:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay! We did it! We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.78,0:17:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.78,0:18:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.55,0:18:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,X!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.43,0:18:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the time of your demise!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So you are Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.92,0:18:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.01,0:18:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.39,0:18:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavenly Father! Please save Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.75,0:19:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.02,0:19:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.66,0:19:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.86,0:19:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the end of Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.66,0:19:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.55,0:19:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.38,0:20:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.75,0:20:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.98,0:20:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.28,0:20:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, it's time for us to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.16,0:20:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Father in Heaven is calling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.87,0:20:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,, I have to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.29,0:20:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I don't want to say goodbye, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.73,0:20:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Father in Heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.92,0:20:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I did my best for Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.65,0:20:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you grant my wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.63,0:20:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Very well, Tink.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.27,0:20:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I shall grant your wish.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.84,0:20:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I will send Sapphire's father and mother back to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.66,0:20:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will take away the boy's heart that you wrongfully gave to Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.69,0:20:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.33,0:21:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.38,0:21:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.54,0:21:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.30,0:21:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.79,0:21:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.90,0:22:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Tink, back to being an angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.70,0:22:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What became of Silverland after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.59,0:22:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Sapphire and Franz?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.15,0:22:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You all want to know, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.28,0:22:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Silverland has returned to the beautiful kingdom it once was.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.86,0:22:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get the plan ready for tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.57,0:23:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.24,0:23:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They say Sapphire and Franz are getting married soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.54,0:23:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll make a wonderfully happy couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.64,0:23:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll be attending the wedding when they do!
